<title>USA: MFC Bancorp buys securities co.</title>
<headline>MFC Bancorp buys securities co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFC Bancorp Ltd said early Monday that it has purchased Robabond Holding AG, a Swiss-based investment dealer specializing in European debt securities and portfolio management.</p>
<p>MFC said it acquired Robabond, which is based in Zurich, for about $11.4 million plus a percentage of future earnings.</p>
<p>In connection with the transaction, key senior Robabond principals have subscribed to about $3.5 million in common shares of the company at current market value. The initial purchase payment is equal to about net asset value of the company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
